IMNSHO, don't bother with either. They're magic resistant, so it can take
quite a few scrolls/spells of taming. If you want to blow a wish on a
figurine, go right ahead.

However, my personal favorite pet is an Olog-Hai. Kick-ass regenerating,
weapon-wielding troll "lords". And they only take a single tame spell. In
my experience, after a few levels with you they have enough hit points to
take on dragons; they have something like four attacks.

Common, too; you can almost always find one or two in the lower levels.

